pageType: content
elements:
  - elementId: kicker
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 34, 300, 18]
    content: {style: "$kicker", wrap: false, text: 03 · SYSTEM ARCHITECTURE}
  - elementId: title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 54, 840, 40]
    content:
      style: "$title"
      wrap: false
      text: On-chain holds money & tokens; off-chain holds files & queries
  - elementId: rule
    elementType: line
    bounds: [60, 102, 840, 1]
    viewBox: [840, 1]
    points: "0,0 840,0"
    border: {style: solid, width: 1, color: "$line"}
  - elementId: arch-img
    elementType: image
    bounds: [70, 116, 330, 386]
    src: media/01-system-architecture.png
    fit: {mode: contain}
  - elementId: pt1
    elementType: text
    bounds: [440, 130, 460, 80]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      text: |
        <p><strong>The frontend never routes transactions through the backend</strong> — users sign directly against Sepolia contracts via MetaMask; the backend never touches private keys.</p>
  - elementId: pt2
    elementType: text
    bounds: [440, 225, 460, 80]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      text: |
        <p><strong>Invoice PDFs off-chain, hashes on-chain</strong> — anyone can verify the file is untampered before confirming, balancing evidence with gas cost.</p>
  - elementId: pt3
    elementType: text
    bounds: [440, 320, 460, 80]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      text: |
        <p><strong>A Web3.py event listener syncs continuously</strong> — TransferSingle and other events land in 7 business tables powering dashboards and audit queries.</p>
  - elementId: pt4
    elementType: text
    bounds: [440, 415, 460, 60]
    content:
      style: "$small"
      lineHeight: 1.6
      text: |
        <p>Five interconnected contracts meet the course requirement; Flask is hosted on Render.</p>
        <p>Source: docs/design-EN/diagrams/01-system-architecture.mmd</p>
  - elementId: footer
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 508, 400, 18]
    content: {style: "$small", wrap: false, text: SC6113 · Supply Chain Finance DApp}
  - elementId: page-num
    elementType: text
    bounds: [880, 508, 40, 18]
    content: {style: "$small", align: [right, top], wrap: false, text: "04"}
